  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a1b1f03459967b44090846c84730e678, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialoguePanel: {fileID: 479921341}
  dialogueText: {fileID: 2035444410}
  dialogueMusic: {fileID: 869049663}
  pageFlipSound: {fileID: 0}
  dialogueLines:
  - Welcome to the Museum of Colombian Memory! Beyond these quiet halls lies centuries
    of powerful history...
  - "Be careful, though. Visitors say this museum is full of strange phenomena\u2014some
    paintings seem to have a life of their own."
  - From the Thousand Days' War and the Banana Massacre to El Bogotazo and the 1991
    Constitution, every canvas holds a secret.
  - If you get too close to certain artworks, you might find yourself pulled straight
    into the past!
  - Walk over to the main gallery painting and press E, Space, or Click when you
    are ready to step inside history.
